WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.115 --> 00:00:15.035
Jeremy climbed into bed.

2
00:00:15.036 --> 00:00:29.707
He slept for a long time.

3
00:00:29.708 --> 00:00:43.377
He got up and ate some soup.

4
00:00:43.378 --> 00:00:50.041
Then he slept again.

5
00:00:50.042 --> 00:00:55.557
In a few days, Jeremy felt much better.

6
00:00:55.558 --> 00:00:58.982
He thought about his friends.

7
00:00:58.983 --> 00:01:02.662
"They were very kind to me," Jeremy said.

8
00:01:02.663 --> 00:01:08.607
"I must thank them."

9
00:01:08.608 --> 00:01:19.898
Jeremy found some books for Ribby.

10
00:01:19.899 --> 00:01:23.267
He made a cake for Jemima.

11
00:01:23.268 --> 00:01:30.636
He picked pretty flowers for Mrs. Rabbit.

12
00:01:30.637 --> 00:01:39.643
Jeremy went to Ribby's house first.

13
00:01:39.644 --> 00:01:43.266
"Shall we read together?" he asked.

14
00:01:43.267 --> 00:01:48.289
"My throat feels scratchy," Ribby croaked.

15
00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:55.322
"I can't read today."

16
00:01:55.323 --> 00:01:58.988
Next Jeremy took the cake to Jemima.

17
00:01:58.989 --> 00:02:01.265
She shook her head.

18
00:02:01.266 --> 00:02:04.946
"I'm not hungry." She moaned.

19
00:02:04.947 --> 00:02:13.484
"I have a fever."

20
00:02:13.485 --> 00:02:21.289
Finally Jeremy went to Mrs. Rabbit's house.

21
00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:25.065
"Thank you for the pretty flowers," she said.

22
00:02:25.066 --> 00:02:33.869
"But I am too sick to enjoy them."

23
00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:40.694
Jeremy hopped home.

24
00:02:40.695 --> 00:02:42.507
He shook his head.

25
00:02:42.508 --> 00:02:46.108
"My friends made such a big fuss," he thought.

26
00:02:46.109 --> 00:02:58.631
"Over a little cold!"
